
<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"
      xmlns:i18n="http://xml.zope.org/namespaces/i18n"
      xmlns:metal="http://xml.zope.org/namespaces/metal"
      xmlns:tal="http://xml.zope.org/namespaces/tal"
      metal:use-macro="context/@@main_template/macros/master"
      xml:lang="en"
      i18n:domain="docpool.base"
>
  <metal:content fill-slot="content">

    <main class="mx-3 my-3">
      <section class="row g-2 overview-layout">
        <article class="col-12 col-xl-4"
                 tal:define="event python:view.event_data()"
        >
          <div class="card tile-card overview-event h-100 text-dark">
            <header class="overview-event-header bg-white pt-4 px-4 pb-2">
              <h2 class="overview-event-headline mb-0 fw-normal text-primary"
                  tal:content="python:event['headline']"
              >KKW Grohnde, Deutschland / N 52.034, E 9.410</h2>
            </header>
            <div class="overview-event-placeholder d-flex flex-grow-1 align-items-center justify-content-center p-4 text-center text-secondary"
                 tal:condition="python:not event['has_event']"
            >
              <p class="mb-0"
                 tal:content="python:event['placeholder']"
              >Bitte wählen Sie ein Szenario aus, um die Ereignisdaten anzuzeigen.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="tile-map-wrap"
                 tal:condition="python:event['has_event']"
            >
              <img class="img-fluid tile-map-image"
                   alt="Kartenansicht des Ereignisorts"
                   src="++plone++docpoolui/map-overview.png"
              />
            </div>
            <div class="card-body p-4"
                 tal:condition="python:event['has_event']"
            >
              <dl class="row gx-4 gy-3 mb-0">
                <div class="col-12">
                  <dt class="overview-event-label mb-1 fw-normal text-secondary">Ereigniszeitpunkt und -dauer</dt>
                  <dd class="overview-event-value mb-0 text-dark"
                      tal:content="python:event['event_time_and_duration']"
                  >24.03.2023 09:42 ME(S)Z / 6d 13h 52min</dd>
                </div>
                <div class="col-12 col-sm-6">
                  <dt class="overview-event-label mb-1 fw-normal text-secondary">Ereignisart</dt>
                  <dd class="overview-event-value mb-0 text-dark">
                    <span class="badge bg-warning text-dark fw-normal rounded-pill px-3 py-1"
                          tal:content="python:event['event_type']"
                    >Uebung</span>
                  </dd>
                </div>
                <div class="col-12 col-sm-6">
                  <dt class="overview-event-label mb-1 fw-normal text-secondary">Notfalleinstufung</dt>
                  <dd class="overview-event-value mb-0 text-dark"
                      tal:content="python:event['emergency_classification']"
                  >Ueberregional</dd>
                </div>
                <div class="col-12 col-sm-6">
                  <dt class="overview-event-label mb-1 fw-normal text-secondary">IMIS Betriebsart</dt>
                  <dd class="overview-event-value mb-0 text-dark"
                      tal:content="python:event['operation_mode']"
                  >Intensivbetrieb</dd>
                </div>
                <div class="col-12 col-sm-6">
                  <dt class="overview-event-label mb-1 fw-normal text-secondary">Phase</dt>
                  <dd class="overview-event-value mb-0 text-dark"
                      tal:content="python:event['phase']"
                  >Freisetzungsphase</dd>
                </div>
                <div class="col-12">
                  <dt class="overview-event-label mb-1 fw-normal text-secondary">Referenzszenario</dt>
                  <dd class="overview-event-value mb-0 text-dark"
                      tal:content="python:event['reference_scenario']"
                  >S2 - ....</dd>
                </div>
                <div class="col-12">
                  <dt class="overview-event-label mb-1 fw-normal text-secondary">Kurzbeschreibung</dt>
                  <dd class="overview-event-value mb-0 text-dark"
                      tal:content="python:event['description']"
                  >Im Kernkraftwerk ABC im Ort XYZ kam es gestern um 03:00 Ortszeit zu einem Brand. Fuer weitere Informationen zum Ereignis siehe Meldungen oder Lagebilder.</dd>
                </div>
              </dl>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <div class="col-12 col-xl-8">
          <div class="row g-2 h-100">
            <article class="col-12 col-lg-6">
              <div class="card tile-card h-100">
                <header class="tile-header section-title-wrap">
                  <h3 class="section-title mb-0">Aktuellste Lageinformationen</h3>
                </header>
                <div class="list-group list-group-flush message-list">
                  <div class="list-group-item px-0">
                    <div class="message-item d-flex">
                      <div class="message-side text-center">
                        <div class="message-side-icons">
                          <tal:icon tal:replace="structure python:icons.tag('globe', tag_class='me-2')" />
                          <tal:icon tal:replace="structure python:icons.tag('calendar', tag_class='me-2')" />
                        </div>
                        <span class="badge message-status">Oeffentlich</span>
                        <p class="message-time mb-0">13:06</p>
                        <p class="message-date mb-0">15.05.2024</p>
                      </div>
                      <div class="message-main">
                        <div class="d-flex align-items-start justify-content-between gap-2">
                          <h4 class="message-title mb-1">Messstrategie des BfS zum...</h4>
                          <tal:icon tal:replace="structure python:icons.tag('paperclip', tag_class='me-2')" />
                        </div>
                        <p class="message-text mb-0">Messstrategie des BfS zum RLB Nr 12</p>
                      </div>
                      <div class="message-menu">
                        <tal:icon tal:replace="structure python:icons.tag('menu-dots-vertical', tag_class='me-2')" />
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </div>

                  <div class="list-group-item px-0">
                    <div class="message-item d-flex">
                      <div class="message-side text-center">
                        <div class="message-side-icons">
                          <tal:icon tal:replace="structure python:icons.tag('globe', tag_class='me-2')" />
                        </div>
                        <span class="badge message-status">Oeffentlich</span>
                        <p class="message-time mb-0">13:01</p>
                        <p class="message-date mb-0">15.05.2024</p>
                      </div>
                      <div class="message-main">
                        <div class="d-flex align-items-start justify-content-between gap-2">
                          <h4 class="message-title mb-1">+++ Uebung +++ RLZ Lagebil...</h4>
                          <tal:icon tal:replace="structure python:icons.tag('paperclip', tag_class='me-2')" />
                        </div>
                        <p class="message-text mb-0">Original date: 2021-12-16T12:01:15Z Exercise For Addresses Use Only Die seit 15.12.2021 17:30 Uhr andauernd...</p>
                      </div>
                      <div class="message-menu">
                        <tal:icon tal:replace="structure python:icons.tag('menu-dots-vertical', tag_class='me-2')" />
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <footer class="tile-footer">
                  <a class="tile-link"
                     href="#"
                  >Zeige alle</a>
                  <span class="counter-pill">99</span>
                </footer>
              </div>
            </article>

            <article class="col-12 col-lg-6">
              <div class="card tile-card h-100">
                <header class="tile-header section-title-wrap">
                  <h3 class="section-title mb-0">Meldungen und Anlageinformationen</h3>
